\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Measured cost on one RTX 4090 (24\,GB) with up to two jobs in parallel: elapsed times include resource contention and are not standalone latencies. LoCalPFN fit includes validation; its prediction includes kNN retrieval. DistPFN shares the Global fit and prediction.}}{2}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
