\newlabel{tab:classwise_cic2018}{{3}{2}{Per-class F1 on CIC-IDS2018 (seed 43, test rows in descending order). Proposed = experts (K=6) + scorer/verifier (S1V0 policy), EXP63 K sweep; bold marks the row maximum}{table.3}{}}
